WEBVTT

01:41.440 --> 01:45.990
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.500 --> 01:48.950
[Episode 32]

02:09.380 --> 02:10.380
It's such a simple matter.

02:10.500 --> 02:12.100
I don't believe Xue Ranran is indispensable.

02:14.360 --> 02:15.470
With such a small fire,

02:15.680 --> 02:17.030
it'll take forever.

02:42.079 --> 02:42.630
Guardian.

02:42.750 --> 02:43.430
When cooking and tending the fire,

02:43.430 --> 02:44.470
we absolutely cannot use immortal magic.

02:44.590 --> 02:45.750
Otherwise, the heat control will be off.

02:46.110 --> 02:46.460
Guardian.

02:46.480 --> 02:47.370
Previously, Ranran

02:47.400 --> 02:48.710
would cook for hours at a time.

02:50.240 --> 02:51.480
It's all about patience.

02:52.840 --> 02:54.079
The recipe is indeed complete,

02:54.560 --> 02:55.680
but why didn't she include the cooking time?

02:57.800 --> 02:59.310
I asked you to find disciples who can cook.

02:59.520 --> 03:00.360
Why haven't I heard anything?

03:00.850 --> 03:02.160
Those three from last time

03:02.190 --> 03:03.560
were already the best ones we could find.

03:04.150 --> 03:05.470
The rest

03:06.060 --> 03:06.900
have been spreading rumors about you,

03:07.030 --> 03:08.240
saying you're picky and bad-tempered,

03:08.590 --> 03:09.430
so no one dares to come.

03:11.710 --> 03:12.590
Keep looking then.

03:41.840 --> 03:42.710
Why is there nothing here?

04:15.870 --> 04:16.600
Qi-Replenishing Pills?

04:17.720 --> 04:19.040
How come I didn't notice them before?

04:39.920 --> 04:40.560
Master.

04:40.960 --> 04:41.950
Did you miss me?

04:43.000 --> 04:43.830
Don't come any closer.

04:47.360 --> 04:49.040
Master, your hands are so pretty,

04:49.560 --> 04:50.630
so slender and long.

04:51.240 --> 04:52.600
I've wanted to hold them for a long time.

04:55.870 --> 04:56.950
Why can't I move?

04:58.040 --> 04:59.120
There must be something wrong with those pills.

05:06.120 --> 05:07.950
Master, your embrace is so warm.

05:08.810 --> 05:10.010
Often when I'm practicing,

05:10.040 --> 05:11.000
I think about

05:11.390 --> 05:13.600
you holding me like this, Master.

05:14.750 --> 05:15.870
This way, I can be completely

05:16.120 --> 05:17.310
close to you.

05:25.190 --> 05:26.070
Master.

05:26.600 --> 05:27.950
Your heart is beating so fast.

05:28.930 --> 05:30.330
Could it be that you want to...

05:42.800 --> 05:43.360
Guardian.

05:44.000 --> 05:44.480
Guardian.

05:45.150 --> 05:45.680
Guardian.

05:53.870 --> 05:55.159
Who made these Qi-Replenishing Pills?

05:58.500 --> 05:59.090
Those Qi-Replenishing Pills

05:59.120 --> 06:00.270
were made by Ranran last year.

06:00.720 --> 06:02.720
I heard she used Dream-Inducing Herbs.

06:03.310 --> 06:04.560
Whatever the pill maker was thinking,

06:04.600 --> 06:05.160
the person who takes the pill

06:05.160 --> 06:06.070
will experience the same.

06:18.780 --> 06:20.070
Did I behave inappropriately just now?

06:20.830 --> 06:22.360
Guardian, you were just blushing

06:23.190 --> 06:25.160
and having a kind of

06:28.270 --> 06:29.270
strange expression.

06:29.800 --> 06:30.560
I thought you were sick,

06:30.750 --> 06:31.360
so I tried to wake you up immediately.

06:32.340 --> 06:33.430
Breaking my dietary restrictions,

06:33.680 --> 06:34.390
and also breaking my...

06:35.800 --> 06:37.310
Inducing me to have such an improper dream.

06:38.070 --> 06:39.120
Improper dream?

06:39.800 --> 06:40.190
Guardian,

06:40.390 --> 06:41.600
you seemed quite enchanted just now.

06:41.860 --> 06:42.409
Shut up.

06:46.350 --> 06:47.480
Since I need to focus on cultivation,

06:48.190 --> 06:49.310
I'll go and sever this ill-fated bond.

06:53.240 --> 06:54.430
Where is Guardian going?

06:55.870 --> 06:57.070
Where else could he go?

07:00.030 --> 07:01.850
[Tranquility Pavilion]

07:03.600 --> 07:05.390
Since Uncle Ye Xin made him lose his memory

07:06.000 --> 07:07.920
to use him for his own schemes,

07:08.750 --> 07:09.720
shouldn't I

07:10.040 --> 07:11.120
make him fall in love with me as soon as possible

07:11.440 --> 07:12.760
to break the Soul-Cleansing Charm?

07:17.390 --> 07:18.040
Master.

07:20.950 --> 07:21.950
Master, why are you here?

07:22.600 --> 07:24.040
I'm just here to take back my core

07:24.560 --> 07:25.720
and cut off your bewitchment of me.

07:26.120 --> 07:26.630
Fine.

07:27.070 --> 07:27.720
Come and take it then.

07:28.600 --> 07:29.600
Haven't you considered

07:29.830 --> 07:31.240
why Ye Xin went to such lengths

07:31.390 --> 07:32.240
to make you lose your memory?

07:32.630 --> 07:33.720
If you take the core from me now,

07:33.920 --> 07:35.270
you'll be playing right into his hands.

07:36.360 --> 07:37.040
Besides,

07:37.830 --> 07:38.510
one day,

07:38.510 --> 07:40.070
you'll eventually recall our past.

07:40.390 --> 07:41.040
Can you guarantee

07:41.070 --> 07:42.240
you won't regret it then?

07:43.310 --> 07:44.560
It turned out to be exactly as I imagined.

07:45.430 --> 07:47.000
Then I'll take her back to figure things out first.

07:47.159 --> 07:48.510
It won't be too late to kill her and take the core then.

07:51.070 --> 07:53.190
I don't need you to remind me of such judgment.

07:54.190 --> 07:55.270
Your life

07:55.480 --> 07:56.510
can be ended at any moment.

07:57.190 --> 07:58.070
Why would I regret it?

08:04.920 --> 08:06.040
Sovereign Su, you must be hungry.

08:06.510 --> 08:07.310
Don't be stubborn.

08:07.630 --> 08:09.040
You need to eat well to have the strength to kill.

08:13.240 --> 08:14.000
Alright, alright.

08:14.240 --> 08:15.390
I'm the one who's hungry, okay?

08:15.680 --> 08:17.310
You don't want me to die of starvation either, do you?

08:17.720 --> 08:18.830
Why don't you join me for a hearty meal

08:19.090 --> 08:20.040
before sending me on my way?

08:23.680 --> 08:24.950
I can kill you anytime.

08:25.270 --> 08:26.310
You won't be able to escape anyway.

08:36.030 --> 08:37.200
Do you really not fear me?

08:37.320 --> 08:38.270
You see, every time

08:38.270 --> 08:40.000
you come here furiously, threatening to kill me,

08:40.669 --> 08:42.030
but you never bring yourself to do it.

08:42.799 --> 08:43.799
Surely, each time,

08:44.120 --> 08:44.840
deep down in your heart,

08:45.440 --> 08:46.870
you must be aching, right?

08:48.480 --> 08:49.270
Don't move.

08:55.550 --> 08:56.270
Shameless.

08:56.720 --> 08:57.440
Is this how you've always been

08:57.440 --> 08:58.360
as a disciple?

09:00.080 --> 09:01.840
I was even more outrageous before.

09:02.200 --> 09:02.670
Why?

09:03.030 --> 09:04.390
Are you also eager

09:04.600 --> 09:05.840
to remember the past now?

09:06.240 --> 09:06.790
Of course.

09:07.360 --> 09:08.840
How could I let others manipulate me?

09:10.510 --> 09:11.440
But it's definitely not because of you.

09:13.870 --> 09:14.630
Actually,

09:15.030 --> 09:16.150
I've already found

09:16.270 --> 09:16.670
in the cabin

09:16.670 --> 09:17.910
the way to break the Soul-Cleansing Charm.

09:18.840 --> 09:19.870
The solution is for you

09:20.600 --> 09:22.150
to fall in love with me again.

09:26.120 --> 09:26.670
What?

09:28.790 --> 09:29.600
Nonsense.

09:30.480 --> 09:31.840
I'm telling the truth.

09:32.200 --> 09:33.440
What the Soul-Cleansing Charm erased

09:33.510 --> 09:34.240
was the memories

09:34.240 --> 09:35.390
after you developed feelings.

09:35.840 --> 09:37.270
So as long as you get your feelings back,

09:37.510 --> 09:38.840
your memories will naturally return.

09:39.480 --> 09:40.030
What do you think?

09:41.870 --> 09:43.630
Do you dare to give it a try?

09:44.390 --> 09:44.870
Absurd.

09:45.750 --> 09:46.870
Stop trying to trick me.

09:47.270 --> 09:47.960
Be careful, or I might

09:47.960 --> 09:48.790
take back my Golden Core right now.

09:49.750 --> 09:50.750
This fierce beast turns out

09:50.910 --> 09:52.360
to be a paper tiger.

09:53.600 --> 09:57.030
Immortal Master! Immortal Master! Immortal Master!

10:00.120 --> 10:01.200
I heard from the villagers

10:01.550 --> 10:02.200
that you two

10:02.440 --> 10:03.840
look exactly like

10:03.870 --> 10:05.000
the immortal masters in the statues.

10:05.200 --> 10:06.910
I wonder if you are Immortal Master Ranran

10:07.200 --> 10:08.080
and Immortal Master Su?

10:09.150 --> 10:09.840
It's us.

10:10.240 --> 10:11.240
Sir, has something happened?

10:11.630 --> 10:12.240
Great!

10:12.320 --> 10:13.240
There's hope!

10:13.690 --> 10:15.680
Some children from our village

10:15.790 --> 10:17.200
have been taken away by demons.

10:17.680 --> 10:20.410
Please, Immortal Master, help us!

10:20.440 --> 10:22.790
Please, Immortal Master, help us!

10:26.790 --> 10:27.790
What does that have to do with me?

10:28.270 --> 10:29.440
I haven't even retrieved my belongings yet.

10:30.000 --> 10:30.750
You're not allowed to go either.

10:33.360 --> 10:34.270
This... This...

10:34.550 --> 10:35.120
Master.

10:35.510 --> 10:36.960
This place was originally sparsely populated.

10:37.150 --> 10:37.870
The villagers were once

10:37.870 --> 10:39.000
plagued by the Nine-Headed Kui'ao.

10:39.550 --> 10:40.600
Fortunately, you brought us here that day

10:40.720 --> 10:41.960
to subdue demons and eliminate devils.

10:42.360 --> 10:43.510
Only then did this place return to peace

10:43.790 --> 10:44.960
and gain the vitality it has today.

10:45.790 --> 10:46.790
Immortal Master Su.

10:46.910 --> 10:48.080
Please accept our bow!

10:49.670 --> 10:50.320
Master.

10:51.320 --> 10:52.150
You once told me

10:52.550 --> 10:53.860
that the higher a cultivator's level,

10:53.960 --> 10:54.840
the more responsibility they should bear.

10:55.080 --> 10:56.720
They shouldn't forget how to be a human first

10:56.960 --> 10:58.390
because they're too focused on becoming an immortal.

11:01.750 --> 11:02.870
Did I ever say that?

11:04.030 --> 11:05.390
Or are you making up my words

11:05.390 --> 11:06.080
to insult me?

11:07.870 --> 11:09.300
Although it wasn't your exact words,

11:09.720 --> 11:10.630
your actions

11:10.750 --> 11:11.870
were undeniably true.

11:13.600 --> 11:15.000
You once risked your life

11:15.360 --> 11:16.840
to save the people in the capital

11:16.840 --> 11:18.030
from the Green Dragon's disaster.

11:18.550 --> 11:19.910
If you hadn't been affected by the Soul-Cleansing Charm,

11:20.080 --> 11:20.720
you certainly wouldn't

11:20.720 --> 11:22.120
stand by and watch these villagers suffer

11:22.360 --> 11:23.480
without doing anything.

11:23.750 --> 11:25.000
Sir, you all go back first.

11:25.360 --> 11:26.390
We'll be there soon.

11:27.030 --> 11:30.030
-Thank you, Immortal Master!
-Thank you, Immortal Master!

11:30.670 --> 11:31.910
-That's great!
-That's great!

11:32.110 --> 11:32.910
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

11:33.000 --> 11:33.840
Be careful. This way.

11:34.790 --> 11:35.790
I haven't agreed yet,

11:35.960 --> 11:36.840
and you're already making decisions.

11:37.080 --> 11:38.360
Who's the master between us after all?

11:39.120 --> 11:40.440
I know you'll agree.

11:40.840 --> 11:41.960
The master-disciple order is in chaos,

11:41.960 --> 11:42.750
with the subordinate defying the superior.

11:43.390 --> 11:44.670
I think I was too good to you before.

11:45.360 --> 11:46.000
Yes, indeed.

11:46.440 --> 11:47.240
You were indeed

11:47.600 --> 11:49.510
the person who treated me the best in this lifetime.

11:53.950 --> 11:54.440
Let's go.

12:00.270 --> 12:01.550
There are indeed demons here.

12:03.440 --> 12:04.480
You've already lost your Spirit Root.

12:04.630 --> 12:05.670
What are you going to use to eliminate demons?

12:06.750 --> 12:08.270
I can borrow spiritual power to draw talismans.

12:08.910 --> 12:10.240
To deal with some ordinary demons,

12:10.440 --> 12:10.840
that's enough.

12:13.360 --> 12:14.630
I'll wait here then.

12:15.150 --> 12:16.510
If you die in there,

12:16.960 --> 12:18.150
I can just take the core.

12:47.910 --> 12:49.910
These spotted spiders live in colonies in burrows.

12:50.120 --> 12:51.550
They were originally gentle in nature.

12:51.910 --> 12:52.720
Why did they become

12:52.720 --> 12:54.150
so terrifying?

12:54.480 --> 12:55.320
They've become so bloodthirsty

12:55.320 --> 12:57.120
that they don't even spare their own kind.

13:27.080 --> 13:28.670
You almost died, yet you didn't call for help.

13:29.030 --> 13:30.120
If I hadn't sensed danger,

13:30.150 --> 13:30.720
you would have already become

13:30.720 --> 13:31.630
a snack in its stomach.

13:34.200 --> 13:35.480
You're so reluctant to see me die, huh?

13:37.270 --> 13:38.360
I'm just worried about my core

13:38.360 --> 13:39.600
being eaten by that monster.

13:40.150 --> 13:41.320
You say you want to kill me,

13:41.670 --> 13:43.150
but you're so worried about me dying.

13:44.440 --> 13:45.480
It seems there's still a good chance

13:45.630 --> 13:46.790
for you to fall in love with me again.

14:05.150 --> 14:06.150
You go shut it up.

14:06.270 --> 14:07.120
I'll go save the children.

14:07.600 --> 14:08.550
You dare to order me around?

14:14.200 --> 14:15.000
My spiritual power?

14:15.550 --> 14:17.000
The spiritual power you borrowed to draw talismans is mine?

14:17.320 --> 14:17.790
That's right.

14:18.360 --> 14:19.120
Don't get distracted.

14:19.140 --> 14:19.810
Focus on the task at hand.

14:40.390 --> 14:41.150
Don't be afraid.

14:41.170 --> 14:42.360
I'm here to save you.

15:10.030 --> 15:11.030
Everything is okay now.

15:11.080 --> 15:12.610
The monsters are all dead.

15:15.280 --> 15:16.120
Well done.

15:17.200 --> 15:18.240
Watch your tone.

15:24.910 --> 15:25.960
I'll give you some candy.

15:26.150 --> 15:27.480
No more crying after you eat the candy.

15:28.270 --> 15:28.840
Do you want some?

15:29.390 --> 15:31.000
Mu Qingge used to win people over

15:31.000 --> 15:31.720
in the same way.

15:32.600 --> 15:34.150
Mu Ranwu is following her example.

15:35.390 --> 15:36.360
But judging from her appearance,

15:36.360 --> 15:37.510
it seems to be genuine.

15:40.080 --> 15:41.550
Why has Mu Ranwu changed

15:41.890 --> 15:43.200
after reincarnation?

15:44.210 --> 15:44.850
Ranran.

15:46.080 --> 15:46.750
Yishui.

15:47.740 --> 15:48.600
Yishui, Ranran.

15:51.480 --> 15:52.440
Are you alright?

15:53.660 --> 15:54.570
That day in the netherworld,

15:54.600 --> 15:55.510
we parted in a hurry.

15:56.000 --> 15:57.600
Have your injuries healed, Elders?

15:58.270 --> 15:59.390
Thanks to your rescue,

15:59.510 --> 16:00.440
they've already recovered.

16:00.870 --> 16:02.510
Why have you come to Puxin Village?

16:03.110 --> 16:04.510
Are you also here specifically to exorcise demons?

16:05.480 --> 16:06.200
We were just passing by.

16:13.750 --> 16:15.200
The Devil's Pill from the netherworld?

16:16.720 --> 16:18.050
No wonder these ghost-headed spiders

16:18.080 --> 16:19.030
are so violent.

16:19.540 --> 16:20.150
The day before yesterday,

16:20.180 --> 16:22.010
when we were exorcising demons at the foot of Mount Hollow,

16:22.550 --> 16:23.150
it was quite similar

16:23.150 --> 16:24.550
to the scene with these ghost-headed spiders now.

16:24.910 --> 16:26.440
Some usually rare ferocious beasts

16:26.720 --> 16:27.960
suddenly went berserk and attacked people.

16:28.570 --> 16:29.970
Such abnormal events

16:30.240 --> 16:31.600
occurring on such a large scale

16:32.640 --> 16:34.450
must be part of Ye Xin's plan

16:34.480 --> 16:35.440
to escape from the netherworld.

16:38.120 --> 16:39.030
This is a matter of great importance.

16:39.860 --> 16:40.770
Let's send these children

16:40.790 --> 16:41.390
back home first.

16:41.630 --> 16:42.750
Then we can sit down and discuss in detail.

16:47.480 --> 16:49.320
Since we received your last message,

16:49.510 --> 16:50.270
disciples from various sects

16:50.390 --> 16:51.910
have been secretly investigating Ye Xin's background.

16:52.570 --> 16:53.380
However, this person

16:53.400 --> 16:54.320
is extremely mysterious.

16:54.510 --> 16:55.720
Despite obviously possessing astonishing cultivation,

16:55.740 --> 16:57.640
he has left no trace of his life story.

16:58.030 --> 16:58.750
If it weren't for

16:59.360 --> 17:00.790
taking in Mu Qingge and her sister,

17:01.440 --> 17:02.120
probably

17:02.360 --> 17:03.790
no one would have noticed

17:03.790 --> 17:04.829
the existence of this person even now.

17:05.400 --> 17:07.349
Moreover, this person is extremely cautious.

17:07.940 --> 17:08.460
I sent people

17:08.490 --> 17:09.770
to follow Mu Qingge for over a month,

17:10.240 --> 17:11.200
but apart from knowing that Ye Xin

17:11.200 --> 17:12.160
resides in the Eastern Palace,

17:12.550 --> 17:13.760
we couldn't uncover any

17:13.790 --> 17:14.750
other traces of his activities.

17:15.680 --> 17:17.069
If the devilization of these demons

17:17.270 --> 17:18.270
was truly his doing,

17:18.990 --> 17:20.400
what could his intentions be?

17:21.589 --> 17:22.750
This person is shrouded in suspicion.

17:23.270 --> 17:24.400
I'm afraid there will be more

17:24.400 --> 17:25.790
devilized creatures appearing in the future.

17:26.240 --> 17:26.750
For now,

17:26.880 --> 17:27.960
we can only follow this lead

17:27.960 --> 17:28.880
and continue investigating.

17:30.200 --> 17:31.920
We will keep a close watch on this matter.

17:33.270 --> 17:33.750
By the way,

17:33.900 --> 17:35.850
demonic cultivators have always been fond of researching evil techniques

17:35.880 --> 17:36.930
and the art of devilization.

17:37.410 --> 17:38.760
I wonder if the Celestial Sect

17:38.790 --> 17:39.310
will have clues

17:39.310 --> 17:40.350
that we don't know about.

17:40.510 --> 17:41.070
I think

17:41.510 --> 17:42.960
perhaps we could pay a visit to the Celestial Sect.

17:43.200 --> 17:43.920
I'll go with you.

17:46.960 --> 17:47.720
There's no time to waste.

17:47.960 --> 17:48.830
We'll take our leave now.

17:52.200 --> 17:52.720
Wait.

17:55.070 --> 17:56.270
I have a question.

17:56.920 --> 17:57.960
Do you two

17:58.350 --> 17:59.950
live here together?

18:06.000 --> 18:07.070
How inappropriate.

18:07.720 --> 18:08.550
A man and a woman living alone together.

18:08.860 --> 18:10.230
You should know the importance of avoiding suspicion.

18:10.830 --> 18:11.590
Don't talk nonsense.

18:12.720 --> 18:13.650
Yishui and Ranran

18:13.680 --> 18:15.000
have long confirmed their feelings for each other.

18:15.640 --> 18:16.400
It's not like they're strangers.

18:20.880 --> 18:22.040
So you've noticed

18:23.400 --> 18:24.510
what's going on between us.

18:25.640 --> 18:26.790
What do you mean "what's going on between us"?

18:27.620 --> 18:28.140
Yishui.

18:28.640 --> 18:29.480
Since that's the case,

18:29.880 --> 18:31.240
we don't need to hide it anymore.

18:34.240 --> 18:35.550
You wouldn't want people to know

18:35.890 --> 18:37.500
that you've lost your memory due to the Soul-Cleansing Charm, would you?

18:37.880 --> 18:38.640
Just play along.

18:42.960 --> 18:44.070
I just don't understand.

18:44.680 --> 18:45.370
Apparently, both of you

18:45.400 --> 18:47.160
are people of exceptional talent.

18:47.550 --> 18:48.480
As long as you focus on cultivation,

18:48.750 --> 18:49.960
you'll surely attain ascension soon

18:50.030 --> 18:50.750
and embark on the path to immortality.

18:52.240 --> 18:53.830
If necessary,

18:54.270 --> 18:55.440
you can cultivate together then.

18:55.830 --> 18:57.270
Wouldn't that be better without hindering each other?

18:57.730 --> 18:58.530
Why indulge in

18:58.550 --> 19:00.120
these worldly emotions and romance now?

19:00.350 --> 19:01.500
You're setting a bad example

19:01.830 --> 19:03.070
for the Heavenly cultivators.

19:03.640 --> 19:04.680
This is not good.

19:05.240 --> 19:05.920
Not good at all!

19:06.110 --> 19:06.640
Yan Liangyu.

19:07.960 --> 19:08.880
If you can't speak properly, don't speak at all.

19:09.480 --> 19:10.480
I am sincerely

19:10.510 --> 19:11.440
advising them.

19:14.030 --> 19:14.960
How about this?

19:14.960 --> 19:16.000
After the current crises are over,

19:16.230 --> 19:17.070
we'll have Miss Ranran over

19:17.310 --> 19:18.240
to stay at the Eternal Sect temporarily.

19:18.960 --> 19:19.920
This way, you won't have to stay together

19:20.070 --> 19:20.880
and develop distracting thoughts

19:21.070 --> 19:21.870
which will affect your cultivation.

19:22.530 --> 19:23.800
Xue Ranran will stay by my side.

19:23.830 --> 19:24.440
She's not going anywhere.

19:24.920 --> 19:26.070
Whether we ascend

19:26.310 --> 19:27.110
or whether we become immortal partners

19:27.110 --> 19:28.160
is none of your concern.

19:29.750 --> 19:30.310
Also,

19:32.680 --> 19:33.920
if we set our wedding date some day,

19:34.350 --> 19:35.720
we'll invite you to the celebration, Senior.

19:38.160 --> 19:38.640
Su...

19:39.110 --> 19:39.920
Su Yishui.

19:40.750 --> 19:42.030
It's time to let go completely.

19:43.000 --> 19:44.200
If I remain infatuated with this,

19:44.890 --> 19:46.400
even I will grow tired of myself.

19:47.510 --> 19:48.160
Ranran.

19:49.200 --> 19:50.630
Don't waste the good match heaven has bestowed upon you.

19:51.070 --> 19:52.160
What's meant for you in this life,

19:52.960 --> 19:54.200
I only hope you cherish it well.

19:54.830 --> 19:55.720
Yishui and I would like

19:55.750 --> 19:57.030
to thank you for your blessings, Elder Wen.

19:57.440 --> 19:58.750
Elder Wen, you have a kind and graceful heart,

19:58.920 --> 19:59.790
and a deep understanding of righteousness.

20:00.200 --> 20:01.480
May you also meet a good man soon.

20:02.110 --> 20:02.640
Thank you.

20:03.240 --> 20:04.070
We'll be going then.

20:05.610 --> 20:06.040
Let's go.

20:09.640 --> 20:10.310
Wen.

20:18.210 --> 20:19.170
Master, didn't you just say

20:19.200 --> 20:20.310
you wanted to marry me?

20:20.440 --> 20:22.090
How can you abandon me now?

20:23.200 --> 20:24.510
It was just an act.

20:24.600 --> 20:25.360
How could it be taken seriously?

20:25.750 --> 20:26.680
Don't be unreasonable.

20:35.350 --> 20:35.930
Wen.

20:36.660 --> 20:37.380
Slow down.

20:38.200 --> 20:39.240
Wen, wait for me.

20:41.000 --> 20:42.240
Those words you just said...

20:44.920 --> 20:45.880
Have you really let go?

20:48.340 --> 20:49.580
I have no other intentions.

20:50.220 --> 20:51.020
I just feel that

20:51.200 --> 20:52.240
after all these years, you've finally

20:52.270 --> 20:52.920
let go of the knot in your heart

20:53.350 --> 20:54.030
and your obsession.

20:54.920 --> 20:55.680
I'm happy for you.

20:59.110 --> 20:59.750
Thank you,

21:00.310 --> 21:01.000
but it's not necessary.

21:02.280 --> 21:03.080
I admit that

21:03.110 --> 21:04.270
I had some prejudice

21:04.790 --> 21:05.880
against Su Yishui before.

21:06.550 --> 21:07.880
But he's indeed not what I thought he was.

21:08.240 --> 21:08.920
I was narrow-minded.

21:09.440 --> 21:10.200
But whether it's 20 years ago

21:10.830 --> 21:11.520
or 20 years later,

21:11.550 --> 21:12.550
this guy always

21:13.030 --> 21:14.270
indulges so much in the worldly pleasures.

21:14.750 --> 21:15.510
It's really not good.

21:16.310 --> 21:16.960
Wen.

21:17.480 --> 21:19.400
Let's not make such a foolish mistake

21:19.610 --> 21:20.410
and delay our path to immortality.

21:21.200 --> 21:21.960
How about we supervise

21:22.550 --> 21:23.790
each other from now on?

21:24.160 --> 21:25.110
And after we attain ascension together,

21:26.400 --> 21:27.480
we can become partners

21:30.330 --> 21:31.170
and make progress together.

21:33.590 --> 21:34.160
Wen.

21:34.790 --> 21:35.680
What do you think?

21:36.070 --> 21:37.200
You'd better find someone else.

21:37.640 --> 21:38.850
I'm hurrying to Mount Red Flame

21:39.170 --> 21:40.450
to see what exactly is the problem with

21:40.480 --> 21:41.510
the reopened Celestial Sect.

21:44.350 --> 21:45.000
Wen.

21:46.790 --> 21:48.180
Don't you also feel that

21:48.440 --> 21:49.350
being chivalrous

21:49.510 --> 21:51.070
and helping others is really fulfilling?

21:51.680 --> 21:53.070
That's just who you are.

21:55.240 --> 21:55.920
Xue Ranran.

21:56.200 --> 21:57.200
You've got some nerve.

21:57.550 --> 21:58.310
Now you're trying to lecture me?

21:58.750 --> 21:59.480
Who's the Master here,

21:59.480 --> 22:00.400
me or you?

22:01.680 --> 22:03.110
Now that the matter of the village is resolved,

22:03.440 --> 22:04.790
it's time to settle things between us.

22:06.070 --> 22:06.510
You...

22:06.920 --> 22:07.640
Don't even think about it.

22:08.310 --> 22:09.840
I'd like to keep my life for now.

22:10.480 --> 22:11.110
How about

22:11.440 --> 22:13.030
we put the matter of the Golden Core on credit for now

22:13.270 --> 22:13.750
and deal with it later?

22:15.440 --> 22:16.920
You've got quite a few tricks up your sleeve.

22:17.200 --> 22:17.830
Put it on credit?

22:18.480 --> 22:19.680
What's in it for me?

22:20.160 --> 22:21.480
I can find ways

22:21.550 --> 22:22.510
to help you regain your memory

22:22.920 --> 22:24.680
and figure out Ye Xin's intentions.

22:25.000 --> 22:25.720
Also,

22:26.030 --> 22:27.110
I can keep you company to relieve your boredom,

22:30.640 --> 22:31.510
and cook delicious meals for you.

22:36.830 --> 22:37.960
All these things you mentioned,

22:38.070 --> 22:39.160
I can do them myself.

22:39.960 --> 22:40.550
However,

22:40.880 --> 22:41.640
I've been thinking,

22:42.160 --> 22:43.640
since I took you as my disciple before,

22:44.110 --> 22:45.510
there must have been a reason for it.

22:46.440 --> 22:47.640
I just accidentally forgot.

22:48.640 --> 22:49.240
So,

22:49.900 --> 22:50.820
you might as well stay.

22:51.820 --> 22:52.850
But I don't keep idle people around.

22:53.640 --> 22:54.480
As clumsy as you are,

22:54.790 --> 22:55.480
the only thing you're decent at

22:55.480 --> 22:56.350
is cooking.

22:56.720 --> 22:58.200
Just stay at Mount Wester and cook for me.

22:58.240 --> 22:59.110
I'll let you keep the Golden Core for now.

22:59.720 --> 23:00.350
Really?

23:01.240 --> 23:02.070
Thank you, Master.

23:02.200 --> 23:02.880
I'll definitely

23:02.880 --> 23:03.720
prepare every meal with care

23:04.310 --> 23:05.790
and make sure you taste delicacies from all over the land.

23:06.350 --> 23:07.160
Xue Ranran.

23:07.750 --> 23:09.030
Do you think I'm doing this because I'm greedy for food?

23:09.590 --> 23:10.440
I practice abstinence from food in my cultivation.

23:10.590 --> 23:11.830
I've long since cut off my desire for food and drink.

23:12.240 --> 23:13.580
I'm only letting you stay because I see you don't have any ill intentions.

23:13.610 --> 23:14.460
I'm just cutting you some slack.

23:17.110 --> 23:18.310
Before I attain ascension,

23:18.630 --> 23:19.520
having a meal occasionally

23:19.550 --> 23:21.270
to comfort myself a bit is fine.

23:22.030 --> 23:22.680
Got it.

23:24.550 --> 23:25.720
Then why are you still standing there?

23:25.970 --> 23:26.760
Hurry up and pack your things.

23:26.790 --> 23:27.590
Come back to Mount Wester with me.

23:27.960 --> 23:29.510
Only by staying by Master's side

23:30.090 --> 23:30.950
do I have a chance

23:30.970 --> 23:32.480
to make him fall in love with me again.

23:33.490 --> 23:34.010
Just wait and see.

23:37.750 --> 23:38.880
She has my Golden Core.

23:39.200 --> 23:40.510
Of course, letting her stay by my side

23:40.510 --> 23:41.350
is the safest option.

23:53.630 --> 23:54.400
[Supreme Map of Thousand Spell]

24:10.310 --> 24:11.680
During today's refining,

24:11.920 --> 24:13.640
the Spirit Spring in my heart became unstable again.

24:14.180 --> 24:15.930
I need to go see the Black-Robed Magician as soon as possible

24:15.960 --> 24:16.750
and ask him to help me suppress it.

24:30.240 --> 24:30.880
Who is it?

24:32.550 --> 24:33.810
The Black-Robed Magician?

24:38.070 --> 24:38.680
That's right.

24:39.200 --> 24:40.240
This is the Black-Robed Magician.

24:44.590 --> 24:45.160
How come there's

24:45.160 --> 24:46.110
a portrait of a Magician here?

24:49.790 --> 24:51.600
This is a portrait of Ye Xin.

24:52.880 --> 24:53.550
Oh, right.

24:53.880 --> 24:55.310
Last time you came to this cabin,

24:55.390 --> 24:56.550
you mentioned that this portrait

24:56.550 --> 24:57.440
looked familiar to you.

24:57.920 --> 24:58.680
Could it be...

24:58.750 --> 25:00.270
The Black-Robed Magician is Ye Xin?

25:01.880 --> 25:02.750
Which means

25:03.290 --> 25:04.320
Uncle Ye Xin has known all along

25:04.350 --> 25:05.110
that you are the Demon's child.

25:05.500 --> 25:06.260
He was the one who initially

25:06.280 --> 25:08.110
wanted to refine the Demon's child to obtain the Spirit Spring.

25:09.750 --> 25:10.400
However,

25:10.960 --> 25:11.920
even with several Heavenly Sects joining forces

25:11.920 --> 25:13.550
to investigate the identity of the Demon's child, they found nothing.

25:14.220 --> 25:15.670
Why does he know everything so clearly?

25:17.160 --> 25:18.160
He actually set up

25:18.160 --> 25:19.110
so many moves so early.

25:19.680 --> 25:20.480
I'm afraid his identity

25:20.510 --> 25:21.790
is even more extraordinary than we thought.

25:23.270 --> 25:24.160
Ye Xin...

25:26.440 --> 25:27.350
Ye Xin...

25:29.350 --> 25:30.310
Whose obsession is this?

25:31.200 --> 25:31.850
Dun Tian's.

25:34.420 --> 25:36.880
Chang'e must regret stealing the spiritual medicine...

25:37.550 --> 25:39.640
Gazing at the blue sky night after night with a heavy heart.

25:40.000 --> 25:40.920
What did you think of?

25:41.960 --> 25:42.750
Dun Tian.

25:43.750 --> 25:45.030
Back then, he slayed the Mortal-Demon Lord

25:45.030 --> 25:45.750
and attained ascension,

25:46.120 --> 25:47.170
but he didn't step in to save

25:47.200 --> 25:48.590
his wife and daughter who were trapped by evil spirits.

25:49.280 --> 25:50.680
After that, he was filled with regret.

25:51.240 --> 25:52.720
He would often go to the Memory Cave,

25:52.830 --> 25:53.480
watch

25:53.480 --> 25:54.880
the happy memories of himself and his family,

25:55.270 --> 25:56.270
and recite these lines:

25:56.640 --> 25:58.240
"Chang'e must regret stealing the spiritual medicine,

25:58.550 --> 25:59.960
gazing at the blue sky night after night with a heavy heart."

26:00.790 --> 26:02.680
"Gazing at the blue sky night after night with a heavy heart?"

26:03.750 --> 26:05.640
The Black-Robed Magician also goes by the alias "Night Heart", which is "Ye Xin."

26:06.720 --> 26:08.110
So the Magician is Ye Xin,

26:08.480 --> 26:09.240
who's none other than

26:09.240 --> 26:10.240
the once-great savior, Dun Tian?

26:13.270 --> 26:13.960
That's right.

26:14.270 --> 26:15.160
I felt that day

26:15.290 --> 26:16.230
the barrier at the Eastern Palace

26:16.230 --> 26:17.750
couldn't have been created by mortal magic.

26:18.030 --> 26:18.750
Now that I think about it,

26:18.800 --> 26:20.120
only immortal magic could have accomplished that.

26:21.000 --> 26:22.000
If he is Dun Tian,

26:22.270 --> 26:23.550
then everything falls into place.

26:25.960 --> 26:27.650
Everyone thought that years ago, Dun Tian

26:27.680 --> 26:29.030
had already perished.

26:29.200 --> 26:30.110
But now it seems

26:30.340 --> 26:31.820
it was just his ruse to escape from the Immortal Realm

26:31.960 --> 26:33.310
and conceal his whereabouts.

26:33.830 --> 26:35.310
But why did he go to such lengths?

26:35.480 --> 26:36.440
What exactly is it for?

26:43.270 --> 26:44.590
Uncle Ye Xin once said

26:45.640 --> 26:47.070
that he adopted us sisters

26:47.670 --> 26:49.320
because we resembled his two daughters.

26:50.610 --> 26:51.920
These past few days, I've been searching through

26:51.940 --> 26:53.010
some notes he left behind.

26:53.480 --> 26:55.310
They contain scattered records of

26:55.330 --> 26:57.030
some universe-reversing, heaven-defying techniques.

26:58.070 --> 26:59.590
Connecting all of this,

27:00.000 --> 27:01.640
it seems like he's been trying to do something

27:02.270 --> 27:03.510
to make up for his regrets.

27:04.480 --> 27:05.510
Dun Tian's wife and daughter

27:05.530 --> 27:06.860
have been dead for hundreds of years.

27:07.030 --> 27:08.240
The Reincarnation Tree can't be used.

27:08.790 --> 27:09.880
If he wanted to resurrect them

27:10.000 --> 27:11.200
or turn back time,

27:12.510 --> 27:13.070
it would indeed be

27:13.070 --> 27:14.480
an unimaginable heaven-defying act.

27:22.270 --> 27:23.790
I finally managed to use the death escape technique

27:23.960 --> 27:25.070
to deceive the Immortal Realm

27:25.350 --> 27:26.550
and return to the mortal world.

27:27.350 --> 27:29.030
I'll use this identity for now.

27:30.440 --> 27:31.960
As long as I don't use immortal power,

27:32.620 --> 27:34.330
I shouldn't be detected.

27:35.570 --> 27:36.200
Demon's child.

27:38.030 --> 27:38.750
Spirit Spring.

27:39.750 --> 27:41.160
The sooner I find you,

27:42.170 --> 27:43.850
the sooner I can realize my plan

27:44.640 --> 27:46.070
and bring you back.

27:47.070 --> 27:48.000
Greetings, Your Highness.

27:49.070 --> 27:50.000
You say

27:50.500 --> 27:52.950
you can help me conquer the universe?

27:53.440 --> 27:54.170
That's correct.

27:54.730 --> 27:56.210
First, you need to obtain the Demon's child,

27:57.270 --> 27:58.350
which means you need to find

27:58.370 --> 27:59.690
your lost son,

28:01.680 --> 28:02.590
Su Yishui.

28:08.880 --> 28:10.030
This drop of Spirit Spring

28:10.310 --> 28:12.310
is a relic of the Celestial Sect.

28:12.750 --> 28:14.550
Infusing it into the Demon's child

28:15.310 --> 28:17.350
will ensure absolute success.

28:26.480 --> 28:27.440
Yu'er. Wan'er.

28:27.880 --> 28:28.510
It won't take much longer.

28:29.350 --> 28:30.920
I'm close to success.

28:31.440 --> 28:32.240
When that time comes,

28:32.920 --> 28:34.400
you'll be just like them,

28:35.160 --> 28:36.830
staying by my side every day.

28:48.190 --> 28:49.110
Mu Qingge.

28:49.760 --> 28:51.080
If I had known you'd be this much trouble,

28:51.590 --> 28:53.510
I shouldn't have taken you in back then.

28:53.920 --> 28:56.030
You want to seal the Spirit Spring back into the netherworld?

28:56.510 --> 28:57.550
I won't allow it.

29:03.440 --> 29:04.590
It seems if we want to fully activate

29:04.590 --> 29:05.680
the ancient formation

29:05.980 --> 29:07.220
and seal the Spirit Spring,

29:08.510 --> 29:10.110
only the Demon's child can do it.

29:18.030 --> 29:19.240
Which fallen immortal are you?

29:19.680 --> 29:20.590
I didn't expect

29:21.030 --> 29:22.990
you'd come to the netherworld.

29:23.270 --> 29:24.350
Uncle Ye Xin.

29:29.410 --> 29:30.090
Qingge.

29:30.880 --> 29:32.110
Hand the Spirit Spring over to me.

29:32.950 --> 29:34.670
Sure enough, you're also after the Spirit Spring.

29:37.370 --> 29:38.090
I see.

29:39.000 --> 29:40.130
I should have known.

29:40.750 --> 29:41.880
Your immortal powers are profound,

29:42.400 --> 29:43.720
unlike those of mortal cultivators.

29:44.480 --> 29:46.160
So you really are from the Immortal Realm.

29:48.510 --> 29:50.400
For the sake of our years together,

29:51.270 --> 29:52.960
I won't kill you.

29:53.720 --> 29:55.000
Hand over the Spirit Spring quickly!

29:56.470 --> 29:58.560
Thank you for raising me, Uncle Ye Xin.

29:59.840 --> 30:00.990
But even if it's you

30:01.720 --> 30:02.920
who want to harm the mortal world,

30:04.110 --> 30:05.200
I won't allow it.

30:05.590 --> 30:06.880
You're no match for me.

30:07.640 --> 30:09.640
I made a lot of preparations before coming.

30:10.520 --> 30:12.280
Although I can't activate the ancient formation

30:12.310 --> 30:13.240
and seal the Spirit Spring,

30:14.000 --> 30:15.040
I can still

30:15.070 --> 30:16.270
use its power

30:16.510 --> 30:17.350
to seal an immortal.

31:38.740 --> 31:39.910
Mu Qingge.

31:45.440 --> 31:46.830
Since I secretly left the Immortal Realm,

31:47.030 --> 31:48.480
my immortal powers were already limited.

31:49.480 --> 31:51.350
Besides, my true self is sealed.

31:52.270 --> 31:53.960
This avatar left in the mortal world

31:54.680 --> 31:56.350
can't exert much power.

31:57.790 --> 31:58.350
I'll wait.

32:00.030 --> 32:01.350
As long as the Demon's child

32:03.590 --> 32:05.030
and the Spirit Spring are still there,

32:06.200 --> 32:08.400
there's another chance for everything.

32:18.120 --> 32:18.760
I'm almost there.

32:20.550 --> 32:21.440
I'll soon be able to

32:21.440 --> 32:22.790
start everything over.

32:24.640 --> 32:26.510
Does the recent demon surge everywhere

32:27.510 --> 32:28.590
have anything to do with you?

32:33.790 --> 32:34.400
Your Highness.

32:34.960 --> 32:35.960
What are you talking about?

32:36.720 --> 32:38.070
You know what I need

32:38.070 --> 32:39.200
in our plan.

32:39.510 --> 32:41.110
It has nothing to do with the demon surge at all.

32:41.790 --> 32:42.880
It better not be you.

32:44.580 --> 32:45.290
Remember,

32:46.000 --> 32:47.440
I don't care what you do,

32:48.130 --> 32:49.130
but you must not harm

32:49.160 --> 32:50.270
my people in the slightest.

32:50.920 --> 32:52.070
Please rest assured, Your Highness.

32:52.830 --> 32:54.000
I will definitely help you

32:54.550 --> 32:55.720
achieve your wishes, Your Highness.

32:56.350 --> 32:56.960
Good.

32:57.920 --> 32:59.590
I'll wait for your good news

33:08.000 --> 33:09.110
Don't be fooled by his appearance.

33:09.110 --> 33:10.200
He may seem compliant,

33:10.830 --> 33:11.550
but he's in no way

33:11.550 --> 33:12.480
an easy person to control.

33:14.240 --> 33:15.440
All under heaven bustling,

33:15.790 --> 33:16.880
all for profit.

33:17.310 --> 33:19.070
As long as I can get what I want,

33:19.680 --> 33:21.640
nothing else matters to me.

33:22.440 --> 33:23.790
What about the demon surge?

33:24.590 --> 33:25.310
You went behind Su Yu's back

33:25.310 --> 33:26.590
and had me secretly promote it.

33:27.190 --> 33:28.260
What's the purpose of that?

33:30.880 --> 33:32.240
When the demon surge rises,

33:32.720 --> 33:33.960
those Heavenly righteous sects

33:34.110 --> 33:35.350
will surely take action.

33:35.880 --> 33:36.680
By then,

33:37.680 --> 33:38.590
I will be able to obtain

33:38.590 --> 33:39.510
what I want.

33:40.320 --> 33:41.560
What kind of

33:41.590 --> 33:42.440
heaven-defying method in this world

33:43.000 --> 33:44.540
could possibly bring Dun Tian's wife and daughter back to life

33:44.560 --> 33:45.480
and change the past?

33:46.510 --> 33:48.200
Could it be related to

33:48.400 --> 33:49.270
the current demon surge?

33:49.880 --> 33:51.240
No matter what Dun Tian does,

33:52.030 --> 33:52.960
he has been scheming against me

33:52.960 --> 33:53.830
since over 20 years ago.

33:54.510 --> 33:55.240
Now he has placed

33:55.240 --> 33:56.110
the Soul-Cleansing Charm on me.

33:57.650 --> 33:58.930
I must settle this score

33:58.960 --> 33:59.640
with him.

34:00.310 --> 34:01.880
Dun Tian wants you to lose your memory

34:02.000 --> 34:02.880
and forget your emotions.

34:03.160 --> 34:04.240
He must have some ulterior motives.

34:05.270 --> 34:06.440
His repeated schemes against you

34:06.720 --> 34:07.510
are truly vicious.

34:08.030 --> 34:08.760
In that case,

34:08.909 --> 34:10.389
we must not let his plot succeed.

34:10.630 --> 34:12.360
We must remove the Soul-Cleansing Charm as soon as possible.

34:16.070 --> 34:17.230
Are you trying to provoke me?

34:18.630 --> 34:20.000
I do have my own agenda,

34:20.800 --> 34:22.190
but what's more important now is that

34:22.440 --> 34:23.960
the only way to restore your memory

34:24.070 --> 34:25.480
is for you to fall in love with me again.

34:33.280 --> 34:34.070
Master.

34:34.760 --> 34:36.070
Why don't you take a small loss

34:36.480 --> 34:37.360
and make a little sacrifice?

34:38.230 --> 34:40.030
Let me have a try.

34:43.110 --> 34:44.360
It's not impossible.

34:45.030 --> 34:46.510
Let me see what you're capable of.

34:46.800 --> 34:47.590
Go ahead and try your best.

34:48.360 --> 34:49.400
So you've agreed?

34:58.230 --> 34:58.760
These...

34:59.800 --> 35:00.760
These little tricks

35:01.150 --> 35:02.030
won't be enough to move me.

35:03.440 --> 35:04.070
No rush.

35:04.480 --> 35:05.480
Let's take it one step at a time.

35:06.110 --> 35:07.320
We'll do everything

35:07.550 --> 35:08.440
we've done before all over again.

35:21.760 --> 35:22.510
It smells so good.

35:28.090 --> 35:28.730
Eat up.

35:28.760 --> 35:29.320
It's really delicious.

35:32.030 --> 35:33.140
What madness has come over me?

35:33.550 --> 35:35.110
Why am I crowded here with a bunch of mediocre people,

35:35.360 --> 35:36.360
eating a bowl of pig offal soup?

35:36.990 --> 35:38.110
What kind of person is this?

35:38.140 --> 35:38.950
Exactly. Let's go.

35:43.440 --> 35:44.000
Xue Ranran.

35:44.710 --> 35:45.400
So you used

35:45.400 --> 35:46.710
this kind of stuff to seduce me before?

35:47.880 --> 35:48.710
You used to

35:48.960 --> 35:50.190
take me to places like this

35:50.190 --> 35:51.030
for meals all the time.

35:52.190 --> 35:52.800
Forget it.

35:53.410 --> 35:54.280
This is all to complete

35:54.280 --> 35:55.440
the task of recovering my memories.

35:57.920 --> 35:58.400
Master.

35:58.840 --> 36:00.360
Try the chili oil here,

36:00.510 --> 36:01.840
together with this hot soup.

36:02.000 --> 36:03.360
I guarantee you'll find it worth coming.

36:04.630 --> 36:05.710
I never eat spicy food.

36:05.920 --> 36:07.000
You don't eat spicy food?

36:16.230 --> 36:17.440
If there's anything you want to eat,

36:17.510 --> 36:18.480
buy it and take it back to Mount Wester to eat.

36:19.010 --> 36:19.850
Don't ever bring me

36:19.880 --> 36:21.030
to such noisy places again.

36:25.320 --> 36:26.590
You keep saying you love me,

36:26.760 --> 36:27.550
but you don't even know

36:27.550 --> 36:28.230
what I dislike?

36:29.920 --> 36:30.710
I've never

36:30.960 --> 36:32.360
heard you mention that before.

36:33.890 --> 36:34.810
I'm afraid you weren't

36:34.840 --> 36:36.070
really sincere towards me before, either.

36:40.360 --> 36:41.030
Also,

36:41.440 --> 36:42.590
Mount Wester isn't short of money.

36:43.280 --> 36:44.480
From now on, get rid of

36:44.550 --> 36:45.470
these shabby clothes.

36:47.630 --> 36:48.440
But you used to

36:48.590 --> 36:49.190
like it a lot

36:49.190 --> 36:50.440
when I wore these clothes.

36:51.320 --> 36:52.320
They're hideous.

36:53.580 --> 36:54.200
Turns out Master

36:54.230 --> 36:55.710
doesn't really like places like this.

36:56.800 --> 36:57.800
Before, in Wuma Town,

36:57.820 --> 36:59.050
it was even noisier than here.

36:59.670 --> 37:00.800
Some places even required queuing

37:00.800 --> 37:02.280
for an hour to get in,

37:02.800 --> 37:04.510
yet he never showed even a hint of disdain.

37:05.670 --> 37:06.710
At Chen's Pan-fried Bun Shop,

37:06.710 --> 37:07.880
he also happily said he liked

37:08.150 --> 37:09.880
the chili oil I mixed for him.

37:11.480 --> 37:12.070
So in fact,

37:12.630 --> 37:14.110
all of that was to accompany me

37:14.280 --> 37:15.230
and make me happy.

37:15.230 --> 37:16.320
He intentionally changed for that.

37:17.190 --> 37:17.960
Master.

37:18.630 --> 37:19.920
From now on, feel free

37:20.110 --> 37:21.230
to tell me what you like

37:21.320 --> 37:22.440
and dislike.

37:22.880 --> 37:24.280
You don't have to consider me in everything.

37:26.590 --> 37:27.360
Is that a newly thought up

37:27.380 --> 37:28.650
trick to please me?

37:29.590 --> 37:30.230
I suppose so.

37:30.920 --> 37:32.030
Since you don't like it here,

37:32.230 --> 37:33.000
let's go then.

37:33.480 --> 37:34.670
But you haven't finished eating yet.

37:35.320 --> 37:36.360
A little while longer won't hurt.

37:36.800 --> 37:37.360
I'll wait for you.

37:39.000 --> 37:39.630
Master.

37:40.800 --> 37:42.150
You're still the same as before.

37:44.960 --> 37:46.440
I'm just trying to complete the task

37:46.770 --> 37:47.970
and regain my feelings and memory sooner.

37:48.000 --> 37:48.840
It's good for both of us.

37:49.000 --> 37:49.630
Bear that in mind.

37:51.110 --> 37:51.840
Got it.

37:52.200 --> 37:53.330
You go wait for me at the village entrance.

37:53.360 --> 37:53.960
I'll go buy some things

37:53.960 --> 37:55.150
to take back to Mount Wester.

37:55.480 --> 37:56.030
I'm off.

37:56.550 --> 37:57.550
Don't keep me waiting.

37:57.960 --> 37:58.710
Got it.

38:12.710 --> 38:13.190
Come on, Miss.

38:13.190 --> 38:13.630
Take a look.

38:18.800 --> 38:19.190
Boss.

38:19.450 --> 38:20.300
How much is this?

38:20.440 --> 38:21.280
Five cash, Miss.

38:23.190 --> 38:24.630
Selling pastries here.

38:25.920 --> 38:26.760
What would you like, Miss?

38:27.590 --> 38:28.480
I'll have a pastry, please.

38:28.550 --> 38:29.150
No problem.

38:34.110 --> 38:35.110
That'll be three cash in total.

38:36.360 --> 38:36.880
Okay.

38:40.440 --> 38:40.960
Here you go.

38:41.000 --> 38:41.400
Thank you.

38:41.590 --> 38:42.150
Take care.

38:43.760 --> 38:44.440
Don't rush.

38:44.590 --> 38:45.400
One at a time, please.

38:46.230 --> 38:46.880
This is mine.

38:50.230 --> 38:51.590
Madam Battle is recruiting disciples?

38:51.960 --> 38:52.890
I was born in the twelfth lunar month

38:52.920 --> 38:53.840
between 11 pm to 1 am.

38:54.400 --> 38:54.760
Good.

38:55.150 --> 38:55.840
You stay.

38:56.030 --> 38:56.590
Okay, okay.

38:57.670 --> 38:59.280
Your birth time doesn't match.

38:59.880 --> 39:00.880
Leave.

39:01.590 --> 39:03.320
Only accepting disciples born during Yin hours.

39:04.320 --> 39:05.440
So they don't care about background

39:05.840 --> 39:06.760
and spiritual channel,

39:07.110 --> 39:08.000
only about birth time?

39:08.190 --> 39:08.920
We only want those born in the twelfth lunar month

39:09.030 --> 39:09.710
between 11 pm to 1 am.

39:10.590 --> 39:11.190
Those are all

39:11.190 --> 39:12.190
birth times with the strongest Yin energy.

39:13.030 --> 39:13.630
What exactly is Mu Ranwu

39:13.630 --> 39:14.670
up to?

39:15.230 --> 39:16.960
Your birth time doesn't match.

39:17.070 --> 39:17.480
I am...

39:21.840 --> 39:22.610
Wang Suizhi?

39:25.150 --> 39:26.320
This unworthy disciple, Wang Suizhi,

39:26.920 --> 39:27.710
greets you, Master.

39:29.110 --> 39:29.920
So you know everything now.

39:31.440 --> 39:32.150
Please rise.

39:35.150 --> 39:36.400
I am now Xue Ranran,

39:36.630 --> 39:38.550
and I don't remember much about the past.

39:39.320 --> 39:40.630
Even if you don't remember,

39:41.360 --> 39:42.240
Master,

39:42.840 --> 39:44.070
you will always be my Master.

39:44.550 --> 39:45.760
I have let you down, Master.

39:46.880 --> 39:48.110
I have committed a grave offense.

39:48.760 --> 39:49.320
I knew

39:49.320 --> 39:50.710
that Mu Qingge in the palace was an impostor,

39:50.960 --> 39:52.590
yet I stayed by her side all along.

39:53.840 --> 39:54.480
This disciple

39:56.030 --> 39:56.840
has failed you, Master.

39:57.710 --> 39:59.000
You haven't failed me in any way.

39:59.550 --> 40:01.070
I'm fine now, aren't I?

40:01.840 --> 40:02.510
It's just that

40:02.710 --> 40:03.510
I don't understand.

40:04.200 --> 40:04.890
Since you already

40:04.920 --> 40:05.670
knew everything,

40:06.030 --> 40:07.360
why did you still choose to stay by her side?

40:12.030 --> 40:12.630
You...

40:13.230 --> 40:13.920
Could it be...

40:16.840 --> 40:17.840
Does she know

40:18.110 --> 40:19.190
about your feelings for her?

40:20.230 --> 40:20.920
All I want is

40:22.110 --> 40:23.320
to silently stay by her side

40:24.230 --> 40:24.980
and protect her.

40:26.230 --> 40:26.880
That's enough for me.

40:28.320 --> 40:29.280
She doesn't need to know.

40:30.070 --> 40:31.190
Having feelings for someone

40:31.510 --> 40:32.430
and wanting to protect that person

40:32.840 --> 40:34.230
is not wrong.

40:35.160 --> 40:36.160
Since you've already decided

40:36.190 --> 40:37.590
to stay by her side,

40:38.320 --> 40:39.480
I have only one request,

40:41.110 --> 40:42.440
that is to maintain your principles.

40:42.920 --> 40:43.920
Keep an eye on Mu Ranwu

40:44.590 --> 40:45.440
and help her.

40:46.000 --> 40:47.670
Don't let her go astray again.

40:48.760 --> 40:49.360
I will

40:49.960 --> 40:52.190
definitely follow your instructions, Master.

40:53.880 --> 40:54.360
By the way,

40:55.000 --> 40:56.320
do you know about someone

40:56.590 --> 40:57.760
named Ye Xin who is close to Mu Ranwu?

40:59.360 --> 41:00.030
Recently,

41:00.480 --> 41:01.710
the Immortal Master

41:02.000 --> 41:03.030
who was always by Crown Prince Su Yu's side

41:03.440 --> 41:04.400
has suddenly been replaced by someone else.

41:05.510 --> 41:06.190
That person

41:06.510 --> 41:08.230
indeed has some interactions with Ranwu.

41:09.000 --> 41:09.630
I think

41:09.920 --> 41:10.880
he must be the Ye Xin

41:11.280 --> 41:12.230
that you mentioned, Master.

41:13.070 --> 41:13.710
So Ye Xin has indeed

41:13.710 --> 41:14.800
been by their side all along.

41:16.030 --> 41:16.800
Actually, we have just

41:16.800 --> 41:17.800
recently deduced that

41:18.150 --> 41:18.960
this Ye Xin

41:19.280 --> 41:20.440
is actually Dun Tian.

41:21.030 --> 41:21.920
Dun Tian?

41:22.360 --> 41:23.840
Since he escaped from the netherworld,

41:24.230 --> 41:25.710
there have been demons being devilized everywhere.

41:26.370 --> 41:27.410
Mu Ranwu has also suddenly started

41:27.440 --> 41:29.150
recruiting disciples on a large scale.

41:29.710 --> 41:30.880
I always have a feeling that all of this

41:31.280 --> 41:32.280
is not a coincidence.

41:33.030 --> 41:34.480
Have you noticed anything unusual

41:34.800 --> 41:36.110
while being around Mu Ranwu?

41:38.710 --> 41:39.930
Ranwu always goes to see him

41:39.960 --> 41:40.920
alone.

41:41.310 --> 41:42.080
As for what they've said

41:42.230 --> 41:42.960
or done,

41:43.920 --> 41:44.920
I have no idea.

41:45.490 --> 41:46.600
Dun Tian is planning to do

41:46.630 --> 41:47.590
something heaven-defying.

41:48.160 --> 41:49.330
After all, we were once sisters.

41:49.960 --> 41:51.280
I don't want her to be dragged into

41:51.280 --> 41:52.440
Dun Tian's schemes.

41:53.360 --> 41:54.110
Deep down,

41:54.560 --> 41:55.370
I still hope she can

41:55.400 --> 41:56.590
let go of all her obsessions

41:56.960 --> 41:57.590
and resentments,

41:58.070 --> 42:00.030
and live a peaceful new life.

42:01.400 --> 42:02.360
If there's any unusual movement,

42:03.400 --> 42:04.510
I will do my utmost

42:04.660 --> 42:05.500
to stop her

42:06.070 --> 42:07.070
from making mistakes again.

42:07.590 --> 42:08.840
As for Dun Tian's matters,

42:09.400 --> 42:10.480
I will also investigate secretly.

42:10.760 --> 42:11.630
As soon as I have any news,

42:11.920 --> 42:13.110
I will send you a message.

42:13.760 --> 42:14.230
Thank you.

42:14.960 --> 42:16.000
You must also be careful.

42:25.510 --> 42:26.150
Master.

42:26.400 --> 42:27.070
We can go back now.

42:27.440 --> 42:28.440
I've got gifts

42:28.440 --> 42:29.280
for everyone.

42:31.760 --> 42:32.920
We've only been gone for a few days,

42:33.280 --> 42:34.360
and you're already bringing gifts for them?

42:36.110 --> 42:36.920
Of course.

42:37.280 --> 42:38.670
I've always heard people say

42:38.760 --> 42:39.800
that when you go on a long journey,

42:39.970 --> 42:41.200
you should bring back gifts

42:41.230 --> 42:42.150
for family and friends.

42:42.630 --> 42:44.150
I didn't have much family growing up,

42:44.440 --> 42:45.880
and I never had the chance to travel far.

42:46.360 --> 42:47.550
But now, things are different.

42:47.880 --> 42:49.110
Mount Wester is my home.

42:49.480 --> 42:50.480
Since I've come out,

42:50.630 --> 42:51.710
of course I should bring back gifts

42:51.710 --> 42:52.670
for important people.

42:53.100 --> 42:53.880
Important people?

42:55.630 --> 42:56.800
This is for Xi'er.

42:57.110 --> 42:58.320
This is for Mr. Yu Tong.

42:58.360 --> 42:59.320
This is for Senior Bai.

42:59.670 --> 43:00.510
This is for Senior Gao.

43:00.920 --> 43:01.480
And

43:01.840 --> 43:03.320
this is for Mr. Zeng.

43:03.440 --> 43:04.000
And this one.

43:04.070 --> 43:05.280
This is for Mr. Yu Chen.

43:08.760 --> 43:09.360
What about this one?

43:11.190 --> 43:11.710
This is

43:11.710 --> 43:13.360
some jerky I bought for Bai.

43:13.510 --> 43:14.760
I also bought some for Huang down the mountain

43:14.760 --> 43:15.630
while I was at it.

43:17.230 --> 43:18.480
Didn't you say it was for important people?

43:18.760 --> 43:20.190
Why are there also cats and dogs?

43:20.680 --> 43:22.080
Bai and Huang are

43:22.110 --> 43:22.960
also very important to me.

43:23.920 --> 43:24.710
Fine. Let's get going.

43:25.440 --> 43:26.280
Alright.

43:27.070 --> 43:27.760
This

43:28.500 --> 43:29.830
is for you, Master.

43:30.420 --> 43:32.050
Look at this little angry figure.

43:32.280 --> 43:33.030
Doesn't it look just like

43:33.030 --> 43:33.920
you, Master?

43:34.280 --> 43:35.800
Next time you feel like getting angry,

43:36.030 --> 43:37.320
just give it a good squeeze.

43:37.880 --> 43:38.550
Childish.

43:39.000 --> 43:40.440
Who would like such a thing?
